 our status?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not good. I'm afraid we've crashed into the heart of Sangvis territory. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We'd better leave this place as soon as possible before we're detected."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"True. You have full command, RO."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...I can't compare with M4 in terms of experience in dealing with emergencies..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPII","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't worry. You have our experience to work with. Now get us outta here!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood. Please lend me your strength. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We only have one single objective - leave this place safely. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We can't do this on our own. I'll need you to get in touch with Helian and get a rescue plan from her, M16."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But the weather conditions are terrible right now and the signal isn't too stable. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We have to find a communication outpost first."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPII","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not only is the signal weak, we're also freezing to death, and we're r